---
name: pr-summary
description: Summarise the open pull request for this branch. Use when the user asks what the PR does, for a PR summary, or to explain the pull request before review.
allowed-tools: Bash(gh pr view *)
---

# PR summary

PR: !`gh pr view --json title,body,additions,deletions 2>/dev/null || echo "no open PR for this branch"`

Write a short summary for a reviewer: what the change does, why, and what to look at first. If there is no open PR, say so and summarise the branch's commits instead.
